    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Each one and no",
     "texto": [
      "**Ciascuno** / **ognuno** (each one), **ciascuna** (each one, feminine). **Nessun** (no, not any) goes before a masculine noun: **nessun problema**.",
      "With «nulla» you say «nothing»: **Nulla è difficile** (nothing is difficult)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Several and others",
     "texto": [
      "**Parecchi** (quite a lot, several), **parecchie** (quite a lot, feminine), **vari** / **varie** (various), **altri** (others).",
      "Example: **Ci sono parecchi amici** (there are quite a few friends)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
